                "For both males and Females, negative perfectionism was moderately and positively correlated with SPA, while positive perfectionism was unrelated to SPA. For Females athletes, results showed that both negative perfectionism and SPA made a unique and combined contribution to the prediction of disturbed eating attitudes. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Simple analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Regression";
