        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSubgroup>
                "19 athletes with eating disorders\n33 without disordered eating";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/inclusionCriteria>
                "High performance Female athletes with disordered eating ; competing on national or international levels ; control without disordered eating. Subjects with disordered eating meet two of the major criteria: amaleorrhoea, low BMI or low body fat, purging methods, and bulimic episodes, in addition to two of the following minor criteria: fear of weight gain, feelings of fatness, maintained low weight and increased importance of weight/shape. If participants did not meet these criteria, they were placed in the control group without disordered eating. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/population>
                "Athletes";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sampleSize>
                "52";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportLevel>
                "Professional";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportingPopulation>
                "National and international" .

