<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_1130>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "1130";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Disordered eating attitudes and body dissatisfaction were highly correlated among Kathak dancers";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Simple analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Correlation";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasPopulation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_1130>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasRelation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_1130>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Kathak_dance>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The design of the study was determined by a parent study which is focused on physical fitness and mental health among Kathak dancers. The inclusion and exclusion criteria for both Kathak dancers and non-dancers including gender, were already etablished. This narrower focus reduces the generalizability. The study utilized two well-etablished questionnaires but did not include a clinical assessment of ED attitudes. All data were self reported. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "One";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should continue to study ED behaviors among Kathak dancers, and also include other forms of classical Indian dance. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
                " r=.51, p<.001";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDirection>
                "+";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sampleSizeMobilized>
                "206";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportPracticeType>
                "Individual sport";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/typeOfAnalysis>
                "Correlation" .

