        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "The results demonstrating a significant and positive relationship between social physique anxiety and DEAB (i.e., generic DEAB, vomiting-purging behaviors, eating related control). Higher levels of SPA tend to be more associated with high levels of eating related control for boys and girls, this relation is more pronounced for boys. ";
