<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_1290>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "1290";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Several factors identified in this study (e.g., athlete status, perfectionism) appear to play a role in the development of ED in this population. The study of other factors such as athletic identity and the coach-athlete relationship could provide insight into the development of ED symptoms within this group of athletes. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Simple analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Correlation";
