<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_1560>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "1560";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Study 1 : athletic identity was not associated with global disordered eating behaviors. \nStudy 2 : athletic identity appeared to be associated with less cognitive restraint and was not significantly associated with other measures of disordered eating. Only exercise identity was associated with disordered eating. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Simple analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Correlation";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasPopulation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_1560>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasRelation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_1560>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Soccer%2C_basketball%2C_baseball%2C_softball%2C_football%2C_field_hockey%2C_lacrosse%2C_volleyball%2C_swimming%2C_track_and_field%2C_cross_country%2C_cheerleading%2C_dance%2C_equestrian%2C_gymnastics>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "Different disordered eating measures were used across study 1 and 2. Neither study 1 nor study 2 collected data about level of sport participation. Both studies were cross-sectional. This study included a broad sample of university students and findings may not generalize to other populations. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Exercise identity may be an important risk factor to consider in future research related to disordered eating and exercise behaviors in college students. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
