        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Basketball%3B_cheerleading%3B_cross-country%3B_diving%3B_fencing%3B_field_hockey%3B_golf%3B_gymnastics%3B_ice_hockey%3B_lacrosse%3B_sport_shooting%3B_rowing%3B_soccer%3B_softball%3B_swimming%3B_synchronized_swimming%3B_tennis%3B_track_and_field%3B_volleyball%3B_cross-country_skiing%3B_alpine_skiing>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "All data were self reported, which allowed for the possibility of socially desirable responding. The cross sectional design did not allow for determining temporal relationships among the variables and eating pathology. ";
