<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_1818>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "1818";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Results support the importance of teammate body comparison, pressure, and relationships for muscularity oriented disordered eating and weight and shape concerns amongst collegiate athletes. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Simple analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Correlation";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasPopulation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_1818>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasRelation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_1818>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/N.A.>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The study had varying rates of participation across varsity and club athlete groups that led to unequal representation in the final sample and inhibited group comparison. The study small sample size. The data were self-reported, cross-sectional and collecte from athletes from only one division I university. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Interventions such as educational programming amongst teams, compaings including on social media to promote positive repesentation of embodiment among athletes, as well as access to appropriate mental health resources are needed to protect athletes from disordered eating habits and negative body image comparisons. Future studies could utilize the model created to further explore the nunances of athlete-teammate relationships in larger, more diverse athlete populations and sporting environments. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
                "r=.46, p<.01";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDirection>
                "+";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sampleSizeMobilized>
                "156";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportPracticeType>
                "Mixed sport";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/typeOfAnalysis>
                "Intercorrelation" .

