                "χ²(5)=7.79, GFI=.98, CFI=.99, RMSEA=.069, standardized RMR=.038\nAppearance pressure from teammate-depth of teammate relationships 𝛃=.02, N.S.\nAppearance pressure from teammate-teammate body comparison 𝛃=.25, p<.001\nDepth of teammate relationship-athletic ideal internalization 𝛃=.06, N.S.\nAppearance pressure from teammate-athletic ideal internalization 𝛃=.41, p<.001\nDepth of teammate relationships-teammate body comparison 𝛃=.26, p<.001\nAthletic ideal internalization-teammate body comparison 𝛃=.50, p<.001\nTeammate body comparison-weight and shape concerns 𝛃=.57, p<.001\nAthletic ideal internalization-weight and shape concerns 𝛃=.23, p<.01\nAthletic ideal internalization-muscularity oriented disordered eating 𝛃=.46, p<.001\nWeight and shape concerns-muscularity oriented disordered eating 𝛃=.33, p<.001\nAthletic ideal internalization R²=.17\nTeammate body comparison R²=.47\nWeight and shape concerns R²=.54\nMuscularity oriented disordered eating R²=.49\n";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDirection>
                "NA";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sampleSizeMobilized>
                "156";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportPracticeType>
                "Mixed sport";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/typeOfAnalysis>
                "Path analysis" .

