                "Performance approach goals were positive predictors of emerging disordered eating attitudes. Mastery avoidance goals were also positive predictors of disordered eating attitudes. Performance avoidance was a protective factor. A relationship between mastery approach and disturbed eating attitudes did not emerge in the structural equation model or the correlation table. ";
