                "Internal locus-disordered eating 𝛃=N.S.\nInternal locus-self regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of social interaction 𝛃=.43, p<.01\nExternal locus of coach and friends-self regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of negative affect 𝛃=-.29, p<.05\nExternal locus of coach and friends-self regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of social interactions 𝛃=-.69, p<.01\nExternal locus of coach and friends-self regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of lack of anticipation of consequences on performance 𝛃=-.61, p<.01\nExternal locus of coach and friends-disordered eating 𝛃=N.S.\nSelf regulation of eating attitudes in sport context of negative affect-disordered eating 𝛃=-.22, p<.05\nSelf regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of social interactions-disordered eating 𝛃=-.86, p<.01\nSelf regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of lack of anticipation of consequences on performance-disordered eating 𝛃=-.64, p<.01\nSelf regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of negative affect R²=.08\nSelf regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of social interactions R²=.76\nSelf regulation of eating attitudes in sport in context of lack of anticipation of consequences on performance R²=.38\nDisordered eating R²=.77";
