        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Football%2C_netball%2C_hockey>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "Reliability of the CPQ among athletes, with the cronbach alpha value recording substantially bellow the recommaleded level. The use of self report measures. Cross sectional design, which has created difficulty in determining the temporal relations between perfectionism and eating psychopathology. The observed patterns cannot be generalised to the general population. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Explore the similarities and differences in the relationship between perfectionism and eating psychopathology in a sample of clinical patients, non-athletes and athletes. ";
