                "χ2 = 1367.94, df = 693, p < .0001, RMSEA = 0.041(90% CI =_x000D_0.038–0.044), NNFI = 0.94, and CFI = 0.94\nAvoidant attachmalet-parent support 𝛃=-.27, p<.05\nAvoidant attachmalet-coach support 𝛃=-.21, p<.05\nParent support-parent conflict 𝛃=-.51, p<.05\nCoach support-coach conflict 𝛃=-.24, p<.05\nParent conflict-self critical perfectionism 𝛃=.30, p<.05\nCoach conflict-self critical perfectionism 𝛃=.22, p<.05\nSelf critical perfectionism-self esteem 𝛃=-.50, p<.05\nSelf esteem-depression 𝛃=-.65, p<.05\nDepression-eating psychopathology 𝛃=.50, p<.05\nParent support partial R²=.07\nCoach support partial R²=.04\nParent conflict partial R²=.26\nCoach conflict partial R²=.06\nSelf critical perfectionism partial R²=.14\nSelf esteem partial R²=.25\nDepression partial R²=.42\nEating psychopathology R²=.25" .

