        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The data was collected exclusively at colleges with an NCAA Division III program. This lower level of competition may have affected the results. The sample size was small. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
