        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Kickboxing%2C_Brazilian_jiu-jitsu>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The small, single-city sample and cross-sectional design limit generalizability and prevent causal conclusions. Additionally, some measures (e.g., translated scales) were not fully validated";
