                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should use larger samples to better assess disordered eating prevalence in combat sports and explore the role of perfectionism and sport regulations. This could help improve athlete education and safer weight management practices";
