        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Despite engaging in dieting and rapid weight loss, athletes showed relatively low levels of disordered eating, though perfectionism especially maladaptive was associated with these symptoms. Coaches and peers played a key role in shaping weight management behaviors";
