        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "211";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "This study shows that disordered eating is significantly associated with lower HRQOL in adolescent athletes, even at subclinical levels, particularly affecting psychosocial functioning. Female athletes appear more vulnerable to reduced HRQOL.";
