        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The study’s cross-sectional design limits causal interpretation, and some findings (e.g., lack of gender differences) may be sample-specific. Additionally, focusing on total scores may overlook important variations within subdimensions";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "One";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should explore these relationships longitudinally and examine psychosocial factors such as social media and training goals. Targeted interventions promoting positive body image could help reduce MD risk and improve athletes’ well-being";
