        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "Cross sectional design does not allow any conclusions about the direction of causality of the variables. The small sample size. The procedure employed may have led to a selective sample. Results are limited in generalizability as they can be applied only to women who regularly exercise in a fitness center. ";
