        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research is needed to examine current research topic in populations of exercisers other than fitness club members. Future research should replicate results in males, and people involved in other sports than aerobics. Future research should examine other reasons for exercise such as obsessivity-compulsivity. ";
