<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_279>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "279";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "The study also included additional in-depth analyses, such as a linear regression analysis of ED risk in relation to the Body Esteem Scale score, which further reinforces the innovative nature of our work. Our results provide new insights into the role of these factors in shaping the risk of ED,";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Complex analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Model-based analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasPopulation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_279>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasRelation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_279>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Running%2C_hockey%2C_swimming%2C_volleyball%2C_gym%2C_dancing>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "Reliance on self-reported data and a sport-specific sample limits generalizability, while the lack of objective physiological measures restricts the depth of health assessment.";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should include more diverse samples and objective measures. Preventive interventions, especially targeting coaches and body image, are essential to reduce risk in this population.";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
                "Physical attractiveness 𝛃=.063, p=.494 Weight control 𝛃=-.462, p<.001 Physical condition 𝛃=-.057, p=.237 R²=.304 R=.551";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDirection>
                "NS";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sampleSizeMobilized>
                "428";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportPracticeType>
                "Mixed sport";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/typeOfAnalysis>
                "Linear regression analyses" .

