        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "Sample size of the study. The athletes came from the same institutions. Study did not collect detailed dietary information, such as macronutrient composition, we did use validated methods of interpreting athletes eating attitudes and behaviors. No causal relationship between perfectionism and our outcomes could be established because this was a cross-sectional study. ";
