        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should investigate possible interventions to hemp athletes manifest their perfectionistic tendencies in adaptive dimensions rather than maladaptive dimensions associated with an increased risk. Other psychological variables (drive for thinness, self esteem) should also benefit explored to further our understanding of the role of mental health in athletes risk for adverse health conditions. ";
