        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "The coach athlete relationship may be a critical and controllable mediating factor in the development of DE in Female collegiate athletes, especially in endurance sports. The coach athlete relationship did not predict DE for aesthetic athletes. ";
