                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should use longitudinal and multi-informant designs to clarify causal pathways. Interventions targeting coaching styles, self-compassion, and support services are promising strategies to prevent disordered eating in athletes.";
