                "Regression analysis revealed that disordered eating attitudes were significantly positively correlated with anxiety levels (p < 0.001) and Self-Classified Weight (p < 0.001).";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Complex analyses";
