<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_532>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "532";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Dissatisfaction based on body fat was more strongly related to DE than the drive for muscularity. Surfers dissatisfied with their body fat levels were more vulnerable to DE than those with a high drive for muscularity. The surfers who were more concerned with their amount of body fat appeared to be more vulnerable to the onset of anorexia and/or bulimia nervosa. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Complex analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Regression";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasPopulation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_532>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasRelation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_532>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Surf>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The Eating Attitude Test, may not be sensitive to the assessment of eating behaviors typical of individuals with a high drive for muscularity. Some intervening variables related to disordered eating were not evaluated, such as ethnicity, psychological dependence on exercise and socioeconomic level. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "One";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research should use sensitive instruments to assess these behaviors. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
                "Body Shape-Diet 𝛃=.25, R²=.20, p=.001\nDrive for muscularity-Diet𝛃=.31, R²=.27, p=.03\nAll 𝛃=2.23, R²=.30, p=.002";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDirection>
                "NA";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sampleSizeMobilized>
                "175";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/sportPracticeType>
                "Individual sport";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/typeOfAnalysis>
                "Multiple linear regression" .

