        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The cross-sectional design, reliance on self-reported data, and limited sample representativeness restrict causal interpretation and generalizability.";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Longitudinal studies with more diverse samples and additional psychological and contextual variables are needed to better understand the mechanisms underlying eating disorder risk in athletes.";
