        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "It is important to distinguish between pressure on Female and male aesthetic performers. Such preventative measures are essential in professional dancer schools and especially gymnastics clubs. These actions should focus on promoting young aesthetic performer's self-esteem and satisfaction with their activity specific body image, which is essential to reducing the impact of pressure to be thin on their eating and weight control behaviors. Coaches and teachers sould understand the impact of their behaviors and comments that lead aesthetic performers to adopt unhealthy practices and should try to adjust their demands to healthier ideal body requirements for the practice of classical dance or gymnastics. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
                "r=-.55, p<.01";
