<http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Analysis_822>
        a       <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/Analysis>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "822";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "Sociocultural pressures play a central role in disordered eating across genders, with gender-specific pathways—emotion regulation and self-esteem in females, and sport pressures and negative mood in males";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/complexityOfAnalysis>
                "Complex analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/groupStatisticalAnalysis>
                "Model-based analyses";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasPopulation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Population_822>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasRelation>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/data/Relations_822>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/hasSport>
                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/Weight-sensitive_sports_%28i.e.%2C_gravitational_%28e.g.%2C_ski_jumping%29%2C_weight_dependent_%28e.g.%2C_boxing%29%2C_aesthetic_%28e.g.%2C_synchronized_swimming%29%2C_or_endurance_sport_%28e.g.%2C_rowing%29%2C_non-weight-sensitive_sports_%28i.e.%2C_ball_games_%28e.g.%2C_basketball%29%2C_power_%28e.g.%2C_powerlifting%29%2C_technical_%28e.g.%2C_fencing%29%2C_or_motor_sports_%28e.g.%2C_motorcycling%29%29>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "The cross-sectional, self-reported design, lack of model validation, small sample (especially males), and absence of sport-type comparisons limit causal inference and generalizability";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future studies should use longitudinal designs, larger and more diverse samples, and examine differences across sport types, competition levels, and developmental stages";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDegree>
                "(χ2(127) = 403.716, CFI = 0.92, TLI = 0.91, RMSEA = 0.076 [90% CI: 0.068–0.085], SRMR = 0.115, AIC = 17372.892, BIC = 17622.735) Sociocultural pressures-Internalization 𝛃=.880, p<.001 Internalization-body dissatisfaction 𝛃=.555, p<.001 Body dissatisfaction-emotion regulation 𝛃=.404, p<.001 Body dissatisfaction-self-esteem 𝛃=.536, p<.001 Self-esteem-emotion regulation 𝛃=.626, p<.001 Self-esteem-disordered eating 𝛃=.175, p<.05 Emotion regulation-disordered eating 𝛃=.288, p<.001 Internalization R²=.774 Self-esteem R²=.287 Emotion regulation R²=.163 Disordered eating R²=.468";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/relationDirection>
                "NA";
