        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/analysisId>
                "880";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/authorConclusion>
                "High standards and self criticism are positively associated with eating restraint, eating concern, weight concern and shape concern. The associations between self-criticism and eating pathology were not moderated by high standards. Self criticism fully mediated the relationships between high standards and restraint, eating concern, weight concern and shape concern. ";
