        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "One";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "The relationships between high standards, self-criticism and eating disorder risk requires examination in more homogenous sub-groups of dancers, to further identify the risk environments for eating psychopathology. ";
