                <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-vocab/N.A.>;
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/limites>
                "A modestly sized convenience sample of regular exercisers was recruited utilizing a snowball sampling method. Only self-report measures were used to collect the data, and such data are known to include well-etablished methods biases, such as social desirability ad memory recall. The cross sectional design requires caution in interpreting causality. ";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/numberOfSportStudied>
                "Multiple";
        <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/ontology/perspectives>
                "Future research would need to implement longitudinal designs in order to determine the specific directions of the relationships examined. Replicate the study with larger more representative samples and utilizing different recruitmalet techniques. ";
