        skos:description  "A discipline for women practiced on 4 apparatus: the vault, the uneven bars, the balance beam, and the floor. The combination of these 4 apparatuses makes it a very complete discipline. For men, it is practiced on 6 apparatus: the floor, the pommel horse, the rings, the vault, the parallel bars, and the high bar.";
        skos:inScheme     <http://ns.inria.fr/iadas/sport-category-vocab/Sport>;
        skos:prefLabel    "Artistic gymnastic" .

